# Rust
target/
Cargo.lock.bak

# wasm-bindgen-test browser config for `just web-itest` — per-developer and holds
# an absolute browser path, so it is never committed. CI uses the runner's Chrome
# on $PATH and needs no such file.
apps/desktop/web-rs/webdriver.json

# Node / Tauri
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Tauri build artifacts
apps/desktop/src-tauri/gen/

# Local config
.env
.env.local

# Generated output (these are created per-project by `prompt-config generate`)
.prompt-config.yaml
.github/agents
.github/copilot-instructions.md
.opencode

# Shared agent contract — committed and hand-tailored to this repo (see AGENTS.md).
# Everything under .claude/ is ignored EXCEPT the shared hooks, skills, rules, and
# settings; per-user overrides go in .claude/settings.local.json and stay ignored,
# as does the hooks' once-per-session scratch under .claude/.cache/.
.claude/*
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/rules/
!.claude/settings.json

# Local multi-agent review scratch artifacts (comprehensive-review skill)
.full-review/
